WEBVTT

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:01.380
Kakarot, huh?

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:04.090
Just another lower-class warrior child.

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:06.270
We'll send him to one of the frontier planets.

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:07.590
He's no good to us here.

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:09.210
I suppose not.

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:17.170
On planet Vegeta, a baby boy cries out for the first time.

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:20.380
Little could he know, high in the skies above,

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:25.600
both his father and his homeworld are under threat by a fearsome enemy.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:27.940
Resol!

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:38.300
Tua-ra-ta!

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:41.820
Come out, freeze, freeze!

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:43.820
We're starting the battle!

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:45.820
It all comes down to this.

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:51.310
My fate, Planet Vegeta's Kakarots, and yes!

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:54.710
Yours too, Frieza!

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:58.870
WE SETTLE IT!

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:34.130
Geck... Geck-a-run!

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:22.130
where I have failed. One day, you must rise up to avenge the Saiyans of Planet Vegeta.

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:30.000
Redeem the pride of our race. So it came to be that this child from a faraway planet

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:36.100
fell to earth oh dear I can't very well leave you out here all on your own and

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:41.640
thanks to the kindness of a stranger he would make this new world his home I

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:52.190
think I'll call you Goku this is where the story of Goku begins the years passed

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:55.210
and the baby Goku grew to be a strong healthy boy

00:03:55.210 --> 00:04:00.000
but his life would be forever changed when he met a girl named Bulma and joined her

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:05.040
on her quest to find the Dragon Balls, seven magic orbs that when gathered together would

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:08.460
call forth the dragon Shenron to grant a single wish.

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:14.320
Goku met many new friends in his travels and honed his skills as a pupil of the great martial

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:15.780
artist Master Roshi.

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:21.360
Skills that were continually put to the test as he was forced to defend himself and his

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:24.260
friends against a host of dangerous opponents.

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:30.000
Goku's toughest test came when he faced the powerful villain King Piccolo, but the

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:35.180
help of the sage Korin allowed Goku to tap into vast reserves of still hidden strength.

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:40.170
In the battle that followed, the true extent of Goku's otherworldly powers was revealed,

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:45.830
and with a mighty charge, King Piccolo's quest for world domination came crashing to a halt.

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:53.970
However, with his dying breath, King Piccolo had time to hatch one final scheme, and three

00:04:53.970 --> 00:05:00.000
years later, Piccolo Jr. appeared before a grown-up Goku, looking to avenge his father

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:02.130
and resume his evil plans.

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:04.270
Another epic battle ensued,

00:05:04.590 --> 00:05:06.750
and though the two were almost equally matched,

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:11.450
in the end, the new Piccolo still could not withstand Goku's might.

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:15.330
Five years have passed since that fateful day.

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:18.170
Goku married his childhood sweetheart, Chi-Chi,

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:20.870
and the two have enjoyed a quiet life together,

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.090
while the world remained at peace.

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:25.770
Till now.

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:51.150
To battle the return of Goku.

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:09.570
It's lunchtime!

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:22.440
This one ought to do it.

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:37.660
I'm glad you're back.

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:39.160
Have you seen Gohan?

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:40.420
I've got lunch ready.

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:42.230
Well, what are we waiting for?

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:42.970
I'm starving.

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:44.290
Did you even hear what I said?

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:45.930
I asked you where your son is.

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:46.570
Huh?

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:47.390
I don't know.

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:48.390
I thought he was with you.

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:52.090
He must have snuck off to play when I wasn't looking.

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:54.670
You two should eat soon or you'll be late for Master Roshi's.

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:56.110
Okay, I'll go look for him.

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:57.570
He hasn't been gone long.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:59.070
I doubt he's wandered too far.

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:00.000
Right.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.760
Don't worry, I'll find him

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:09.000
You're a pretty bird

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:15.170
My name's Gohan, nice to meet you

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:04.000
Almost!

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:36.180
Gohan!

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:02.460
Did you jump?

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:03.440
What?

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:07.800
Oh, uh, I don't know.

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:10.980
Well, come on.

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:13.010
What do you say we get you home, huh?

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:15.040
Your mom was worried about you.

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:18.140
And don't forget, I'm taking you to meet my old teacher today, too.

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:18.870
Okay.

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:27.230
Oh, boy.

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:29.690
I guess that's just about doing.

00:09:30.890 --> 00:09:31.350
Mm-hmm.

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:06.880
"What the heck was that? A meteor? A UFO?"

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:06.960
How are you?

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:07.960
What do you want?

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:13.780
A power level of only five.

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:14.830
Ha!

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:15.880
Pitiful.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:16.880
Stay back!

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:17.920
Don't come any closer!

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:19.480
Oh shoot!

00:11:19.480 --> 00:11:20.620
I mean it!

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:21.700
Ah!

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:40.200
It's a race of utter weaklings.

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:46.510
There's someone with a decent power level, range 4880.

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:47.890
Where are you, cackle?

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:03.250
What is this power I'm sensing?

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:05.730
It can't be Goku.

00:12:05.730 --> 00:12:21.330
Who's that?

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:28.430
You're not Kakarot.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:29.640
What do you want?

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:33.020
Who are you? You have some business with me?

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.020
No, I thought you were someone else.

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:39.360
Then unless you're looking for trouble, keep moving.

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:43.360
Well, aren't you the feisty one?

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:51.920
And I see why. Power level 322. That's almost respectable.

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:56.010
Almost. It's still nothing compared to me.

00:12:56.010 --> 00:13:00.000
Why you, do you have any idea who I am? No one talks to me like that and gets away.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:09.290
with it. Really? Wrong man. He can't be that powerful, can he? This has only one way to find out.

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:25.480
You call that an attack? Pathetic. Although, it is effective at kicking up dust.

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:34.590
You've finished. That's all you've got. In that case, why don't I show you one of my moves?

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:44.140
A new signal. It looks like another strong power level.

00:13:44.140 --> 00:13:55.010
It's that way. Range 12909 in closing.

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:56.690
It's a big one.

00:13:56.690 --> 00:14:00.000
Certainly the biggest power level on this puny planet.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:02.920
This is it. It must be Kakarot.

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:19.400
He's miles away and I still can't stop trembling.

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:48.390
I got your invitation, so here I am.

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:50.470
Ah, good. I wasn't sure you'd make it.

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:51.990
It's been way too long, huh?

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:54.830
I miss this place. Hasn't changed a bit.

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:56.930
Well, don't be such a stranger.

00:14:57.230 --> 00:15:00.000
You don't always have to wait for an invitation, you know.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:03.850
So, uh, what's ol' Yamcha been up to these days, Bulma?

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:05.600
Oh, that idiot!

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:07.270
I don't even wanna th-

00:15:07.270 --> 00:15:10.750
He made me so mad, I didn't even tell him we were gonna be here today!

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:13.540
I never wanna see him again! I'm done with him for good!

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:16.900
I mean, can you believe it? He took another girl on a-

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:19.890
Guess nothing's changed with those two, either.

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:21.250
Nope, guess not.

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:23.130
Anyway, why isn't Launch here?

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:27.130
Oh, she's long gone. She went chasing after Tien Shinhan five years ago.

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:29.570
*laughs*

00:15:38.190 --> 00:15:41.490
Very good. This power level is moving fast.

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:45.370
We're here! Master Roshi's house!

00:15:54.290 --> 00:15:56.310
So who's the kid?

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:58.810
Yeah, what gives? Are you babysitting him for somebody?

00:15:59.160 --> 00:15:59.600
Hmph!

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:08.890
My son that's right crazy, huh? Come on. Say hi

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:16.790
His name is go on

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:23.880
Go honey, I see so you named him after your dear old grandpa did you uh-huh?

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:30.000
I have to admit this is some surprise. I honestly didn't think you had it in your go-go. He's so cute

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.110
So how are you?

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:35.200
I'm two, I'm four, miss.

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:37.200
Wow, aren't you the little gentleman?

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:38.200
Sure he's yours?

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:40.200
Well, he gets that from Chi Chi.

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:44.580
Tell us some more about yourself, Gohan.

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:46.410
What do you want to be when you grow up?

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:48.420
I'm gonna be a great scholar.

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:52.100
Hey.

00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:57.740
Uh-huh.

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.740
Just like I used to have, remember?

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:02.940
Yeah, that's right.

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:09.820
So, uh, Goku, have you noticed anything I don't know strange about your boy?

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:11.680
What do you mean?

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:15.630
For example, does he start acting different when he sees a full moon or anything?

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.490
Sees a full moon?

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:18.500
No.

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:20.450
But we go to bed pretty early.

00:17:22.740 --> 00:17:24.740
Why'd you ask?

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:26.750
Never mind, it's nothing, it's nothing!

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:30.000
He sure takes after you in the looks department, Goku.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.380
So is he strong like you too?

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:34.300
Well, uh...

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:35.450
It's hard to say.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:36.790
It seems like it sometimes.

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:40.410
But I can't give him any martial arts training to find out for sure.

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:41.710
Chi-Chi won't let me.

00:17:44.310 --> 00:17:44.890
Why not?

00:17:45.110 --> 00:17:46.610
Seems like a waste if you ask me.

00:17:46.850 --> 00:17:47.350
I know.

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:49.310
But Chi-Chi won't budge.

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:52.020
She says the world's been at peace for so long now,

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:53.800
there's no reason to teach him how to fight.

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:56.820
She says he's got to focus on studying in school.

00:17:59.230 --> 00:18:00.000
So...

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:03.620
That little firecracker wife of yours turned out to be a real schoolmarm, did she?

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:04.340
Daddy!

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:09.660
Oh, I can't believe I didn't notice this on Gohan's hat.

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:10.640
Is that a Dragon Ball?

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:12.660
Yep, it's the four-star ball.

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:14.920
It was my grandpa's most prized possession.

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:16.960
I put it on there to remember him by.

00:18:17.600 --> 00:18:21.730
I also found the three-star and the six-star ball when I was out looking for this one.

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:23.100
I keep them back at home.

00:18:24.710 --> 00:18:26.190
Now that takes me back.

00:18:26.190 --> 00:18:28.780
We had some crazy time searching for those things, didn't we?

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:33.080
What's that?

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:33.720
What's wrong?

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:36.590
I... I don't know. Something's coming this way.

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:43.510
You sure about that?

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:44.480
I don't know.

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:48.690
Power! I've never sensed anything like it!

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.160
Here it comes!

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:04.160
What the? Who is that?

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:30.000
This is trouble! I can feel it!

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.000
Finally meet.

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:39.290
You're all grown up, but I could tell it was you at a glance, Kakarot.

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:44.750
My, how you look like our father.

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:47.600
Huh? What does that mean?

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:50.580
Wait, hold on a sec. You know this guy?

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:53.690
Kakarot, what the heck have you been doing here all these years?

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:57.700
Your mission was to terminate every native life form on this planet.

00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:00.000
So, why haven't you carried it out?

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:01.030
Uh...

00:20:01.030 --> 00:20:02.540
Huh?

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:03.760
Eh?

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:05.230
Now look, you.

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:08.330
I don't know who you are, but I think we've heard just about enough.

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:10.110
Time to leave.

00:20:10.110 --> 00:20:11.350
Shoot.

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:12.280
Go.

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:13.710
Or...

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:16.040
Since you don't seem to be good at taking a hint,

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:18.430
maybe you need me to point you in the right direction.

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:19.910
Through it! Get back!

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:20.840
You!

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:23.110
No!

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:25.760
You!

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:29.730
Ah!

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:35.780
Who is this stranger with a tail who claims to know Goku?

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:37.620
The truth is revealed.

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:39.800
Next, Dragon Ball Z Kai.

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:44.690
Hey, it's me, Goku.

00:20:45.150 --> 00:20:46.850
This guy flies and has a tail?

00:20:47.210 --> 00:20:47.920
Who is he?

00:20:48.250 --> 00:20:52.020
Remember, Kakarot, your fate and the pride of the Saiyans.

00:20:53.280 --> 00:21:00.000
If you ever want to see your son alive again, I suggest you do as your brother says.

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:02.750
Next on Dragon Ball Z-Ka!

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.650
The enemy is Goku's brother,

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:07.150
the secret of the mighty Saiyan warriors.

00:21:07.150 --> 00:21:08.550
Don't miss it!
